{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0FsY2hlbXklMjBPZiUyMFRoZSUyMFNwaXJpdCUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Alchemy Of The Spirit","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hFGBVULt7UtaX6yTEBzh59ZTIQ0.jpg","description":"The Great American artist Oliver Black (Xander Berkeley) wakes to discover his wife Evelyn (Sarah Clarke) has died in their bed overnight. Brimming with magical realism, we enter a world in which the misconceptions of our belief in a solid reality are revealed. Space and time bend in a way to challenge the audience with what is real, what is illusion, and what is beyond... \"Alchemy of the Spirit\" explores the mysteries which transcend our physical universe and open a doorway into a different dimension, where ultimately, in the aftermath of death, there is an evolution of life which expands awareness, serenity and inner peace.\n\nReleased 16 Feb 2022 · United States of America · Language: English · 92 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"runtime":"92 min","cast":["Xander Berkeley","Mink Stole","Sarah Clarke","Whip Hubley","Jule Selbo","Matthew Delamater","Alex Coppola"],"director":["Steve Balderson"],"released":"2022-02-16T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Death is only the beginning","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Steve Balderson","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u0y8fhkDOhATvCAWegAtT6vdYws.jpg"},{"name":"Xander Berkeley","character":"Oliver","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hl4wBCJXqpOfaoW2oaH9cCilavg.jpg"},{"name":"Mink Stole","character":"Alex","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kaisU78yJrjYn8xjHZY4zjXkgtu.jpg"},{"name":"Sarah Clarke","character":"Evelyn","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bClQYkwMBVnXrVRs52TFbqX3oVE.jpg"},{"name":"Whip Hubley","character":"Sam Cooke","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lqwleuUWQhLWMJ4ZvAdRGrXgvjT.jpg"},{"name":"Jule Selbo","photo":"https://i